Step1: Download the git in local
In some cases even after download of git it does not reflect quickly. Close and open once
Step2: Initialize the GIT in pycharm terminal
git init
Step3: Clone the Github to local
git clone https://github.com/sairamganapathy/DataScienceProject
Step4: Do not change in master branch, create a new branch
git checkout -b "sairam_branch"
Step5: Make changes as required to the code
Step6: Commit the changes(now changes are made to local copy)
Step7: Push the changes to GitHub(changes are pushed to Github - needs access)
Step8: Go to github and pull request
Step9: This goes to the owner of the project and he will approve the changes

